### Summary / Symptom
Policy submission stuck in 'Processing' after 2025.2 upgrade Underwriters report new business submissions in PolicyCenter hang indefinitely in Processing state. Started immediately after the 2025.2.1 upgrade was deployed to production last night. No error visible to end users, but app server logs show repeated GosuRuntimeException in PolicyPeriod.bind().

### Resolution
Root cause was a Gosu rule override (UWApprovalRule.gs) referencing a deprecated API method removed in 2025.2.1 (PolicyPeriod.getLatestPeriod() renamed to getLatestBoundPeriod()). Patched the custom rule, redeployed, cleared stuck submissions via batch script. Confirmed with Guidewire release notes GW-RN-2025-2-1-004 which documented this breaking change.

